{#
  Base layout — the complete document shell for every generated page.

  Configurable per page (front matter):
    lang / locale ......... supplied by pagination over `locales`
    pageTitle ............. REQUIRED (build fails without it)
    pageDescription ....... REQUIRED
    urlPattern ............ REQUIRED — "/{prefix}events.html". Drives canonical,
                            the hreflang trio, og:url and the language switcher,
                            so a page's address is stated exactly once.
    ogType, ogTitle, ogDescription, ogImage, ogImageAlt,
    ogImageWidth/Height/Type ........ Open Graph overrides
    twitterCard/Title/Description/Image/ImageAlt ... Twitter overrides
    bodyClass ............. e.g. "pbf-page"
    activeNav ............. nav item key, e.g. "events"
    linkMode .............. "relative" (default) or "root" (404 pages only)
    stylesheetsBefore/After ......... extra CSS either side of style.css
    extraHead ............. page-specific head markup (JSON-LD goes here)
    scriptsBefore/After ... extra scripts around main.js
    noindex ............... suppresses canonical/hreflang/OG/Twitter

  `t` is the current locale's UI strings; it is set once here so every partial
  can use it without re-deriving the locale.
#}
{%- set t = ui[locale.code] -%}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ locale.htmlLang }}">
<head>
{% include "partials/head.njk" %}
</head>
<body{% if bodyClass %} class="{{ bodyClass }}"{% endif %}>

{% include "partials/header.njk" %}

{{ content | safe }}

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}

{% include "partials/scripts.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
